                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Berlin Sans FB Demi' fontsize='20' underline='true'>KEY INSIGHTS BASED ON DASHBOARD</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#aa5500' fontname='Berlin Sans FB Demi' fontsize='20'>-&gt;Electronics category generated the highest sales among all product categories. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#aa5500' fontname='Berlin Sans FB Demi' fontsize='20'>-&gt;Home &amp; Furniture category also contributed significantly to overall sales performance. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#aa5500' fontname='Berlin Sans FB Demi' fontsize='20'>-&gt;The East region recorded the highest profit compared to other regions. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#aa5500' fontname='Berlin Sans FB Demi' fontsize='20'>-&gt;The South region showed comparatively lower profit contribution. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#aa5500' fontname='Berlin Sans FB Demi' fontsize='20'>-&gt;Quantity sold is highly concentrated in major cities across the Central and East regions. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#aa5500' fontname='Berlin Sans FB Demi' fontsize='20'>-&gt;The monthly sales trend remained stable throughout the year with slight fluctuations. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#aa5500' fontname='Berlin Sans FB Demi' fontsize='20'>-&gt;Total sales reached $142.3 million, indicating strong overall business performance. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#aa5500' fontname='Berlin Sans FB Demi' fontsize='20'>-&gt;The company earned a total profit of $31.5 million, reflecting healthy profitability. </run>
