                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98122' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98788' x='606' y='939'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#aa5500' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='26' underline='true'>Portfolio Description</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#b07aa1' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18' underline='true'>Project Title: Sales and Profit Analysis Dashboard using Tableau.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='16' underline='true'>Purpose of the dashboard:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#aa00ff' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>This project analyzes sales, profit, and quantity performance across different product categories, regions, and months using Tableau dashboards and visual analytics.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='16' underline='true'>Dataset:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#aa00ff' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>The dataset contains information about product sales, profit, quantity sold, customer locations, and monthly sales trends.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='16' underline='true'>Visualizations Used:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#aa00ff' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>Interactive dashboards were created using bar charts, pie charts, maps, KPI cards, and line charts to identify business trends and regional performance.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='16' underline='true'>Tools &amp; Skills:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#aa00ff' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>Tools &amp; Skills: Tableau, Data Visualization, Dashboard Design, KPI Analysis, Business Intelligence, Storytelling.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#0055ff' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='16' underline='true'>Complete Sample Portfolio Description</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#55aa7f' fontname='Arial Rounded MT Bold' fontsize='12'>This Tableau project focuses on analyzing sales, profit, and quantity performance across different regions and product categories. The dashboard was developed using interactive visualizations</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#55aa7f' fontname='Arial Rounded MT Bold' fontsize='12'>such as bar charts, pie charts, maps, KPI cards, and monthly trend analysis charts.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#55aa7f' fontname='Arial Rounded MT Bold' fontsize='12'>The analysis helps identify top-performing categories, profitable regions, and sales trends over time. Key insights from the dashboard show that the Electronics category generated the highest sales, </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#55aa7f' fontname='Arial Rounded MT Bold' fontsize='12'>the East region recorded maximum profit, and overall sales performance remained stable throughout the year.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#55aa7f' fontname='Arial Rounded MT Bold' fontsize='12'>This project demonstrates skills in Tableau dashboard development, business intelligence, KPI reporting, and data storytelling.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
